sort DefinedTerm

entity BenchmarkRegulationTerm : DefinedTerm
entity IntroductionSection : DocumentPart

rel term_shall_have_meaning_defined_in_section : DefinedTerm, DocumentPart

fact benchmark_regulation_meaning_defined_in_introduction :
  term_shall_have_meaning_defined_in_section(BenchmarkRegulationTerm, IntroductionSection)
